tually begins rising; 0 is silent, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BoostRechargePitch", "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for the driver-only cancellable one-shot when boost charge actually begins rising; 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BoostReleaseAssetId", "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for the one-shot when boost is released without emptying the tank. Blank disables this layer without affecting the rest of the profile. Synthesised file for this profile: boost_release."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BoostReleaseGain", "value": "Linear mix multiplier for the one-shot when boost is released without emptying the tank; 0 is silent, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BoostReleasePitch", "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for the one-shot when boost is released without emptying the tank; 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "CoastAssetId", "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for the loop while running above CoastStartMph without accelerating. Blank disables this layer without affecting the rest of the profile."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "CoastGain", "value": "Linear mix multiplier for the loop while running above CoastStartMph without accelerating; 0 is silent, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "CoastPitch", "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for the loop while running above CoastStartMph without accelerating; 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "DisplayName", "value": "Editor-facing n