w 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "FullBoostSpentAssetId", "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for the special one-shot when a near-full tank is continuously consumed to empty. Blank disables this layer without affecting the rest of the profile."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "FullBoostSpentGain", "value": "Linear mix multiplier for the special one-shot when a near-full tank is continuously consumed to empty; 0 is silent, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "FullBoostSpentPitch", "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for the special one-shot when a near-full tank is continuously consumed to empty; 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "IdleAssetId", "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for the loop strongest near stationary and reduced as vehicle speed rises. Blank disables this layer without affecting the rest of the profile. In this profile it is the idle voice until a rev layer has loaded (and for good if none loads), and when FeelAudioEnabled is false."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "IdleGain", "value": "Linear mix multiplier for the loop strongest near stationary and reduced as vehicle speed rises; 0 is silent, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "IdlePitch", "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for the loop strongest near stationary and reduced as vehicle speed rises; 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "IgnitionAssetId", "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for the one-shot when a valid driver starts a vehicle audio session. Blank disables this layer without affecting the rest of the profile."}, {"attributes": {}, "