rofile whatever its asset id is (the off-load rev layers carry coasting). Any layer accepts <Layer>Disabled."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "DriftLoopDisabled", "value": "True switches the DriftLoop layer off for this profile whatever its asset id is (the stabiliser strain layer carries drifting). Any layer accepts <Layer>Disabled."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "AccelerationEnterDisabled", "value": "True switches the AccelerationEnter layer off for this profile whatever its asset id is (the tip-in bark replaces it). Any layer accepts <Layer>Disabled."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "AccelerationReleaseDisabled", "value": "True switches the AccelerationRelease layer off for this profile whatever its asset id is (the blow-off and pops replace it). Any layer accepts <Layer>Disabled."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "DriftEnterDisabled", "value": "True switches the DriftEnter layer off for this profile whatever its asset id is (the stabiliser strain layer replaces it). Any layer accepts <Layer>Disabled."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "FeelDriveEnabled", "value": "Opts this profile into the feel drive: rev layers, load follower, forced induction, slip strain, drift charge and impact layers. False or missing keeps the standard speed-shaped behaviour."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "AccelerationRevPitchMin", "value": "Playback-speed multiplier of the sustained acceleration loop at rev 0. With AccelerationRevPitchMax it makes that loop follow rev; remove both to keep its pitch fixed."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "AccelerationRevPitchMax", "value": "Playback-speed multiplier of the sustained acceleration loop at rev 1."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BoostLoopRevPitchMin", "value": "Playback-speed multiplier of the boost loop (thruster roar) at rev 0. With BoostLoopRevPitchMax it makes that loo