t, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "DriftChargeReleasePitch", "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for the synthesised release one-shot when a drift mini-boost fires, scaled by the charge that was built; 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "ImpactLightAssetId", "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for the synthesised light impact one-shot (from ImpactLightStuds). Blank disables this layer without affecting the rest of the profile."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "ImpactLightGain", "value": "Linear mix multiplier for the synthesised light impact one-shot (from ImpactLightStuds); 0 is silent, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "ImpactLightPitch", "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for the synthesised light impact one-shot (from ImpactLightStuds); 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "ImpactMediumAssetId", "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for the synthesised medium impact one-shot (from ImpactMediumStuds). Blank disables this layer without affecting the rest of the profile."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "ImpactMediumGain", "value": "Linear mix multiplier for the synthesised medium impact one-shot (from ImpactMediumStuds); 0 is silent, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "ImpactMediumPitch", "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for the synthesised medium impact one-shot (from ImpactMediumStuds); 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "ImpactHeavyAssetId", "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for the synthesised hea