 playback-speed/pitch multiplier for the synthesised landing thump one-shot on FeelLandRevision, scaled by touchdown speed; 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop1AssetId", "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for exhaust pop 1 (pop_1); pops are drawn from a shuffled bag of Pop1..Pop4 on FeelPopRevision when FeelPopStrength is under PopBangStrength, gain scaled by strength. Blank disables this layer without affecting the rest of the profile."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop1Gain", "value": "Linear mix multiplier for exhaust pop 1 (pop_1); pops are drawn from a shuffled bag of Pop1..Pop4 on FeelPopRevision when FeelPopStrength is under PopBangStrength, gain scaled by strength; 0 is silent, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop1Pitch", "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for exhaust pop 1 (pop_1); pops are drawn from a shuffled bag of Pop1..Pop4 on FeelPopRevision when FeelPopStrength is under PopBangStrength, gain scaled by strength; 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop2AssetId", "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for exhaust pop 2 (pop_2). Blank disables this layer without affecting the rest of the profile."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop2Gain", "value": "Linear mix multiplier for exhaust pop 2 (pop_2); 0 is silent, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop2Pitch", "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for exhaust pop 2 (pop_2); 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop3AssetId", "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for exhaust pop 3 (pop_3). Blank disables this layer without affecting the rest of the profile."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop3Gain", "value": "Linear mix multiplier for exhaust pop 3 (pop_3); 0 is silent, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop3Pitch", "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for exhaust pop 3 (pop_3); 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop4AssetId", "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for exhaust pop 4 (pop_4). Blank disables this layer without affecting the rest of the profile."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop4Gain", "value": "Linear mix multiplier for exhaust pop 4 (pop_4); 0 is silent, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop4Pitch", "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for exhaust pop 4 (pop_4); 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Bang1AssetId", "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for exhaust bang 1 (bang_1); played on FeelPopRevision when FeelPopStrength is at or over PopBangStrength. Blank disables this layer without affecting the rest of the profile."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Bang1Gain", "value": "Linear mix multiplier for exhaust bang 1 (bang_1); played on FeelPopRevision when FeelPopStrength is at or over PopBangStrength; 0 is silent, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Bang1Pitch", "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for exhaust bang 1 (bang_1); played on FeelPopRevision when FeelPopStrength is at or over PopBangStrength; 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Bang2AssetId", "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for exhaust bang 2 (bang_2). Blank disables this layer without affecting the rest of the profile."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Bang2Gain", "value": "Linear mix multiplier for exhaust bang 2 (bang_2); 0 is silent, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Bang2Pitch", "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for exhaust bang 2 (bang_2); 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "RevThrottleWeight", "value": "Share of rev that comes from engine load (throttle). rev = RevThrottleWeight x load + RevSpeedWeight x speed / RevReferenceMph + RevBoostWeight x boost, limited to 0..1."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "RevSpeedWeight", "value": "Share of rev that comes from road speed."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "RevBoostWeight", "value": "Rev added while boosting (scaled down for a mini-boost)."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "RevReferenceMph", "value": "Speed at which the speed share of rev is full. Set it near the category's top speed."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "RevRiseSeconds", "value": "Response time when rev rises."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "RevFallSeconds", "value": "Response time when rev falls."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "RevPitchBase", "value": "Engine frequency at rev 0 as a fraction of rev 1 (idle rpm / top rpm; 1000 / 8000 here). Rev layers are pitched and crossfaded on this scale."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "RevNeighbourDetune", "value": "Opposite detune applied to neighbouring rev layers so an overlap does not cancel (0.003 = 0.3 %, limit 0.6 %)."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "RevOffLoadGain", "value": "Off-load level of a rev layer whose Load is Any, relative to its on-load level."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "RevMasterGain", "value": "Multiplier for every rev layer in this profile."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "ReverseLoad", "value": "Engine load used while reversing, as a fraction of full throttle."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "LoadAttackSeconds", "value": "Load follower response when throttle is applied."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "LoadReleaseSeconds", "value": "Load follower response when throttle is released."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "LoadExponent", "value": "Curve applied to load before the thrust/coast swap; below 1 brings the thrust set in sooner."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BarkGain", "value": "Extra on-load gain at tip-in (the bark). 0 disables it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BarkSeconds", "value": "How quickly the tip-in bark dies away."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "LifePitchDepth", "value": "Typical size of the slow random pitch drift on the local engine (0.0025 = 0.25 %). 0 disables it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "LifeLevelDb", "value": "Typical size of the slow random level drift on the local engine, in decibels."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "LifeSeconds", "value": "Time scale of the slow drift."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "TwinEngineDetune", "value": "Detune of the second copy of each on-load rev layer (twin engine beat). 0 disables the copy."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "TwinEngineGain", "value": "Level of the twin copy relative to the main copy. 0 disables the copy."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "TurboSpoolUpSeconds", "value": "Response time when turbo spool rises."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "TurboSpoolDownSeconds", "value": "Response time when turbo spool falls."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "TurboSpoolRevFloor", "value": "Spool reached at full load and rev 0; it grows to 1 at rev 1."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "TurboGainExponent", "value": "Curve from spool to turbo whistle gain; above 1 keeps the whistle quiet until spool is high."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BlowOffLoadThreshold", "value": "Throttle at or above which load counts as sustained for the blow-off."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BlowOffLiftThreshold", "value": "Throttle at or below which a lift is detected."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BlowOffMinLoadSeconds", "value": "Sustained load needed before a lift fires the blow-off."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BlowOffMinSpool", "value": "Least spool for a blow-off; its gain scales with spool."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BlowOffMinIntervalSeconds", "value": "Shortest time between two blow-offs."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BlowOffSpoolKeep", "value": "Fraction of spool left after a blow-off."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "SuperchargerGainExponent", "value": "Curve from rev to supercharger whine gain."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "SuperchargerOffLoadGain", "value": "Supercharger whine level off load, relative to on load."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "TurbineStartRev", "value": "Rev at which the turbine pair starts to enter; it is full at rev 1."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "TurbineOffLoadGain", "value": "Turbine level off load, relative to on load."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "TurbineOctaveStart", "value": "Turbine pitch at rev 0, in octaves relative to the TurbineLow recording. TurbineLow plays at 2^octave, TurbineHigh one octave below that; the pair crossfades between octave 0 and 1."}, {"attributes": {}, "