rationReleaseDisabled", "parent": ["ReplicatedStorage", "Config", "Audio", "VehicleProfiles", "EXOTIC_V10_AUDIO", "Descriptions"], "value": "True switches the AccelerationRelease layer off for this profile whatever its asset id is (the blow-off and pops replace it). Any layer accepts <Layer>Disabled."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "DriftEnterDisabled", "parent": ["ReplicatedStorage", "Config", "Audio", "VehicleProfiles", "EXOTIC_V10_AUDIO", "Descriptions"], "value": "True switches the DriftEnter layer off for this profile whatever its asset id is (the stabiliser strain layer replaces it). Any layer accepts <Layer>Disabled."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BoostBodyAssetId", "parent": ["ReplicatedStorage", "Config", "Audio", "VehicleProfiles", "EXOTIC_V10_AUDIO", "Descriptions"], "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for the thruster roar loop under the boost loop (thruster_roar); full for a held boost, BoostLoopMiniGain for a mini-boost, pitch follows rev. Blank disables this layer without affecting the rest of the profile."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BoostBodyGain", "parent": ["ReplicatedStorage", "Config", "Audio", "VehicleProfiles", "EXOTIC_V10_AUDIO", "Descriptions"], "value": "Linear mix multiplier for the thruster roar loop under the boost loop (thruster_roar); full for a held boost, BoostLoopMiniGain for a mini-boost, pitch follows rev; 0 is silent, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BoostBodyPitch", "parent": ["ReplicatedStorage", "Config", "Audio", "VehicleProfiles", "EXOTIC_V10_AUDIO", "Descriptions"], "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for the thruster roar loop under the boost loop (thruster_roar); full for a held boost, BoostLoopMiniGain for a mini-boost, pitch follows rev; it scales the PitchMin to PitchMax sweep."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "BoostBodyPitchMin", "parent":