O", "Descriptions"], "value": "Playback speed of the high-speed wind buffet loop (wind_buffet) that enters between WindBuffetStartMph and WindBuffetFullMph when its drive value is 0."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "WindBuffetPitchMax", "parent": ["ReplicatedStorage", "Config", "Audio", "VehicleProfiles", "EXOTIC_V10_AUDIO", "Descriptions"], "value": "Playback speed of the high-speed wind buffet loop (wind_buffet) that enters between WindBuffetStartMph and WindBuffetFullMph when its drive value is 1."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop1AssetId", "parent": ["ReplicatedStorage", "Config", "Audio", "VehicleProfiles", "EXOTIC_V10_AUDIO", "Descriptions"], "value": "Roblox audio asset ID for exhaust pop 1 (pop_1); pops are drawn from a shuffled bag of Pop1..Pop4 on FeelPopRevision when FeelPopStrength is under PopBangStrength, gain scaled by strength. Blank disables this layer without affecting the rest of the profile."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop1Gain", "parent": ["ReplicatedStorage", "Config", "Audio", "VehicleProfiles", "EXOTIC_V10_AUDIO", "Descriptions"], "value": "Linear mix multiplier for exhaust pop 1 (pop_1); pops are drawn from a shuffled bag of Pop1..Pop4 on FeelPopRevision when FeelPopStrength is under PopBangStrength, gain scaled by strength; 0 is silent, 1 is the asset's base level, and values above 1 amplify it."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop1Pitch", "parent": ["ReplicatedStorage", "Config", "Audio", "VehicleProfiles", "EXOTIC_V10_AUDIO", "Descriptions"], "value": "Base playback-speed/pitch multiplier for exhaust pop 1 (pop_1); pops are drawn from a shuffled bag of Pop1..Pop4 on FeelPopRevision when FeelPopStrength is under PopBangStrength, gain scaled by strength; 1 is original, below 1 is lower/slower, and above 1 is higher/faster."}, {"attributes": {}, "class": "StringValue", "name": "Pop2AssetId", "parent": ["ReplicatedStorage", "Config", "Audio", "Vehi